{"step_index":68,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-20T02:37:46Z","content":"Three completely different concepts this time. Here's why these are actually clickable:\n\n---\n\n### 🥇 Concept 2: \"The Rewired Brain\" — SAFEST BET\nA photorealistic brain split down the middle — left half tangled/chaotic (dark red), right half clean/organized (teal glow). Book at the base. Text: just \"BEFORE\" and \"AFTER.\"\n\n**Why this is exceptional:** SoulArc's brain thumbnails have **3.1 MILLION combined views**. Brains are PROVEN in this niche. But nobody shows a brain MID-TRANSFORMATION. The before/after split is the most instinctive visual in the world — at 120px on a phone, you see \"brain, two colors, something changed.\"\n\n---\n\n### 🥈 Concept 3: \"The 3:55 AM Decision\" — HIGHEST CEILING\nA dark bedroom. A phone screen glowing at 3:55 AM showing an audiobook player. Headphones beside it. Text: \"CAN'T STOP LISTENING.\"\n\n**Why this is exceptional:** It BREAKS THE FOURTH WALL. The viewer is sitting in a dark room, on their phone, right now. This thumbnail shows THEM. Nobody in the entire Hindi audiobook niche does this. The curiosity hook: \"Someone stayed up until 4 AM for this book? It must be THAT good.\"\n\n---\n\n### 🥉 Concept 1: \"The Lit Mind\" — CULTURALLY POWERFUL\nA human head silhouette with golden light exploding inside where the brain should be. The book below, open, radiating the light into the head. Text: \"YOUR MIND AFTER THIS BOOK.\"\n\n**Why this is exceptional:** \"Kitaab se gyan ki roshni\" — the light of knowledge from a book is a DEEPLY Indian cultural image. Every viewer instantly understands this visual. Gold-on-dark is SoulArc's highest-performing palette.\n\n---\n\n**My recommendation:** Generate Concept 2 first. If CTR is below 6% after 48 hours, swap to Concept 3. All three prompts are paste-ready in the artifact."}
