t thumb size but they create a visual BRIDGE that moves the eye from left to right.\n\n**The Scroller:** \"I see a BRIGHT GOLDEN GLOW on a cream background in my dark YouTube feed. That's a hard contrast. I stop. I see a book shape, some kind of growth, and a head with a brain lit up. This book does something to your mind. I'm curious. Click.\"\n\n---\n\n## Alternative Prompt (Shorter, For Quick Iteration)\n\nIf the full prompt above is too long for vidIQ's input, use this compressed version:\n\n```\n16:9 YouTube thumbnail on warm cream #F2EDE4 background. LEFT 20%: Real \"Atomic Habits\" book by James Clear, angled, small. CENTER 35%: Exponential growth staircase of golden 3D blocks, tiny at the book growing massive toward center-right. All blocks gold monochrome — pale #E8D5A8 smallest, bright #FFAA00 largest, biggest blocks glow and emit golden particles. CENTER-RIGHT 40%: Large human head silhouette in profile facing LEFT, dark brown #2A1A10. Inside the head: brilliant golden brain glow explosion — core #FFF5D0, glow #FFAA00, amber #CC7700, with light rays and rising embers. Golden particles bridge FROM the largest blocks INTO the head. Behind the head only: subtle dark vignette so glow reads clearly. Text: \"TINY\" small near smallest blocks, \"MASSIVE\" large near biggest blocks, charcoal #2A1A10. Bottom: \"AUDIOBOOK 🎧\" small, warm brown. Warm premium style, NOT dark, NOT corporate. Bottom-right empty.\n```\n","Description":"Final mashup thumbnail concept combining user's three favorite elements with professional adjustments for color harmony, element bridging, and mobile readability","Overwrite":false,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\renu5\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\2b145ed9-35fe-4974-bd1c-54311bc3cd9c\\atomic-habits-final-mashup.md","toolAction":"Creating final mashup concept","toolSummary":"Final mashup thumbnail"}}]}
