aircase\n- Block colors: GREEN monochrome palette (matching the brain glow):\n  - Smallest blocks: dark muted green #1A4A2A (subtle, quiet)\n  - Medium blocks: medium green #00884A (growing brightness)\n  - Large blocks: bright green #00CC66 (matching the brain glow color)\n  - Largest 2-3 blocks: electric green #00FF88 with a subtle glow bloom effect\n- The blocks are clean 3D cubes with soft shadows — geometric, NOT cartoon\n- The growth staircase is positioned in the RIGHT portion of the frame\n- It should NOT overlap with the head silhouette — there is clear space between the head and the blocks\n\nTEXT ON THE GROWTH STAIRCASE:\n- \"TINY\" — near the smallest blocks at the bottom, white #FFFFFF, bold sans-serif, SMALL font (about 3% of frame height)\n- \"MASSIVE\" — near the largest blocks at the top, white #FFFFFF, bold sans-serif, LARGE font (about 10% of frame height)\n- The word sizes physically demonstrate the growth — \"TINY\" is tiny, \"MASSIVE\" is massive\n\n=== BOTTOM CENTER ===\n- \"AUDIOBOOK 🎧\" in white #FFFFFF, small clean text with headphone icon\n- Positioned centered at the bottom, about 5% from the bottom edge\n- Small and subtle — NOT competing with the main composition\n\n=== STYLE RULES ===\n- The overall color palette is DARK BLUE + GREEN. No gold. No warm tones. No cream. No beige.\n- The green brain glow is the BRIGHTEST element in the entire frame — it draws the eye immediately\n- The head silhouette has CLEAN SHARP EDGES — no fuzzy/washed-out boundaries\n- The head has a COMPLETE NECK — not cropped at the chin\n- The large brain backdrop in the background is SUBTLE (12% opacity) — it adds depth without competing\n- Must be readable at 120px phone size: viewer sees \"dark frame + bright GREEN GLOW in center + book shape on left\"\n- Bottom-right corner is COMPLETELY EMPTY (YouTube timestamp safe zone)\n- No watermark, no logo, no additional text beyond what's specified\n- Cinematic quality, NOT flat design, NOT infographic, NOT corporate