nThese icons are all STRAIGHT, aligned, evenly spaced — order and structure.\n\nFaint green light particles drifting gently across the right half.\n\nText: \"AFTER\" in bright green #22CC66, bold sans-serif, medium size, positioned upper-right corner. The text looks clean and sharp.\n\n=== BOTTOM CENTER ===\n\"AUDIOBOOK 🎧\" in white #FFFFFF, small, centered.\n\n=== STYLE ===\nThe RED vs GREEN contrast must be IMMEDIATELY vi